              "code": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"><title>Week 10_1</title><style>:root{--bg:#edf5f2;--ink:#192723;--card:#ffffff;--accent:#1d9b7d;--soft:#d9f3eb;--line:#d0ebdf}body{margin:0;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#f3faf7,#ebf6f2);color:var(--ink)}main{max-width:960px;margin:0 auto;padding:60px 22px}.panel{padding:30px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:22px;background:var(--card);box-shadow:0 12px 24px rgba(29,155,125,.08)}h1{margin:0 0 12px;font-size:clamp(2.2rem,5vw,3.5rem)}.steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(180px,1fr));gap:16px;margin-top:24px}.step{padding:18px;border-radius:16px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--soft)}.step strong{display:block;font-size:1.6rem;margin-bottom:8px;color:var(--accent)}.tag{display:inline-block;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--soft);color:var(--accent);font-weight:700}</style></head><body><main><div class=\"panel\"><span class=\"tag\">Week 10_1</span><h1>Git, GitHub & Deployment</h1><p>Track project progress, collaborate clearly, and publish work to the web with confidence.</p><div class=\"steps\"><div class=\"step\"><strong>01</strong><span>Commit</span></div><div class=\"step\"><strong>02</strong><span>Branch</span></div><div class=\"step\"><strong>03</strong><span>Deploy</span></div></div></div></main></body></html>"
